<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1024)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Start from the studio.</b> In Studio Reviews, an ended review can be <b>Started</b> again from a studio Mac &#8212; under the link people were sent, with the host's grades &#8212; when its clips are on a drive that Mac has (kura). Reviews shared from this build on carry what the studio needs.</li>
<li>The studio's End hands the review back, so its host can reopen it later.</li>
<li><i>Tell the host</i> can be unchecked again.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
