<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1022)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Studio Reviews.</b> On a studio Mac, the Review Manager's <i>Studio Reviews&#8230;</i> lists every review in the studio &#8212; whoever hosts it &#8212; and can pause, resume, end or close it to invited people. <i>Tell the host</i> shows them a notice when you do.</li>
<li>A review paused or ended by the studio follows on the host's Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
